: 'NodeNext',\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nBut I didn't set isolatedModules. The warning says set isolatedModules: true. But the error about import.meta is separate. Let me try setting module: 'ESNext' and isolatedModules: true.\n\nActually, the module resolution should be NodeNext for import.meta to work. But in tests, ts-jest might transpile to commonjs by default if not configured. Let me add `module: 'NodeNext', isolatedModules: true` and also `verbatimModuleSyntax: false`.\n\nWait, the error says import.meta only allowed when module is es2020, es2022, esnext, system, node16, node18, node20, or nodenext. So maybe the inline tsconfig isn't being picked up. Let me create a separate tsconfig.test.json or just ensure module is set.\n\nLet me update jest.config.cjs.\n\nAlso fix the date issue: parseBrazilianDate for ISO dates should parse the date portion as local time to avoid timezone issues. Similarly formatDateISO should not convert to UTC. Let me use local date components.\n\nFor '2023-09-24', `new Date('2023-09-24')` treats it as UTC. We should instead parse YYYY-MM-DD as local: new Date(2023, 8, 24).\n\nFor Brazilian format DD/MM/YYYY I already did that correctly.\n\nFor ISO date-time '2012-05-19 18:30:00', I replace with T. `new Date('2012-05-19T18:30:00')` assumes local? Actually with no timezone, it's treated as local. Good.\n\nBut formatDateISO uses date.getFullYear() which returns local. If we parse ISO date as UTC, getFullYear is local, causing off-by-one. So need to parse ISO date without time as local.\n\nLet me fix parseBrazilianDate.\n\nFor normalizeTeamName: The issue is that \"-MG\" suffix is removed, turning \"Atlético-MG\" into \"Atlético\", which then doesn't match the override \"ATLÉTICO-MG\" etc. I need to handle lookup BEFORE removing suffixes OR add 'Atlético' as an override mapping. Better to do lookup before suffix stripping for known variants. Let me reorder so it first checks the override map with the raw name and then stripped.\n\nActually, I can change the logic:\n1. Trim\n2. Check overrides using raw normalized (remove diacritics) + raw with diacritics\n3. Remove suffixes\n4. Check overrides again\n\nThis way Atlético-MG matches ATLÉTICO-MG in first pass.\n\nLet me update normalizer.ts.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_efc819cef0016X2I1hhPyZ4Mv3","sessionID":"ses_1038a1a43ffeeWzYwhyWkjkoD2","messageID":"msg_efc812c3e001Vb4ogHOxhIr1VA"}}
