{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782353416377,"sessionID":"ses_1038a1a43ffeeWzYwhyWkjkoD2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"bash_78","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"node -e \"\nimport { loadDataset } from './dist/loader.js';\nimport { resolve } from 'path';\nconst store = await loadDataset(resolve('data', 'kaggle'));\nconst atleticoMatches = store.matches.filter(m => m.homeTeam === 'Atletico' || m.awayTeam === 'Atletico');\nconst bySource = {};\natleticoMatches.forEach(m => { bySource[m.source] = (bySource[m.source] || 0) + 1; });\nconsole.log('Atletico sources:', bySource);\nconsole.log('Sample Atletico 2019:', atleticoMatches.filter(m => m.season === 2019).slice(0, 5).map(m => ({s: m.source, h: m.homeTeam, a: m.awayTeam})));\n\"","description":"Find source of unqualified Atletico name"},"output":"Atletico sources: { 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv': 562 }\nSample Atletico 2019: [\n  { s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv', h: 'Avai', a: 'Atletico' },\n  { s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv', h: 'Atletico', a: 'Santos' },\n  { s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv', h: 'Ceara', a: 'Atletico' },\n  { s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv', h: 'Atletico', a: 'Gremio' },\n  {\n    s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv',\n    h: 'Atletico Mineiro',\n    a: 'Atletico'\n  }\n]\n","metadata":{"output":"Atletico sources: { 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv': 562 }\nSample Atletico 2019: [\n  { s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv', h: 'Avai', a: 'Atletico' },\n  { s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv', h: 'Atletico', a: 'Santos' },\n  { s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv', h: 'Ceara', a: 'Atletico' },\n  { s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv', h: 'Atletico', a: 'Gremio' },\n  {\n    s: 'Brasileirao_Matches.csv',\n    h: 'Atletico Mineiro',\n    a: 'Atletico'\n  }\n]\n","exit":0,"description":"Find source of unqualified Atletico name","truncated":false},"title":"Find source of unqualified Atletico name","time":{"start":1782353416367,"end":1782353416376}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"There's a weird issue: standings show \"Atletico\" at 6th with 64 pts and \"Atletico Mineiro\" at 14th with 48 pts. That means some matches for Atlético Mineiro are being normalized to \"Atletico\" while others to \"Atletico Mineiro\". This is because one dataset may use \"Atlético\" and another \"Atlético-MG\". I should map \"Atlético\" alone to \"Atletico Mineiro\" since in Brasileirão context it refers to them. But that could affect \"Atlético Goianiense\" if abbreviated as \"Atlético\". Actually \"Atlético Goianiense\" is usually \"Atlético-GO\" or \"Atlético Goianiense\", not plain \"Atlético\". And \"Atlético Paranaense\" might be abbreviated as \"Atlético\" in very old datasets. But for consistency, mapping plain \"Atlético\" to \"Atletico Mineiro\" is reasonable.\n\nAlso, \"Csa\" should be \"CSA\". Not critical but I can add normalization.\n\nAlso \"Atletico\" (no Mineiro) got 64 points, which means many matches for Atlético Mineiro were loaded as \"Atlético\". Let me see which source does that.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_efc8abc85001QOUtDe7G7cE71b","sessionID":"ses_1038a1a43ffeeWzYwhyWkjkoD2","messageID":"msg_efc8a97be001q3NWYa04Dcuxcv"}}
