{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782353634644,"sessionID":"ses_1038a1a43ffeeWzYwhyWkjkoD2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"bash_96","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"node -e \"\nimport { parse } from 'csv-parse/sync';\nimport { readFile } from 'fs/promises';\nconst rows = parse(await readFile('data/kaggle/Brasileirao_Matches.csv', 'utf-8'), { columns: true, skip_empty_lines: true, trim: true, bom: true });\nconst am = rows.filter(r => Number(r.season) === 2019 && (String(r.home_team).toLowerCase().includes('atletico') || String(r.away_team).toLowerCase().includes('atletico')));\nconsole.log('Brasileirao_Matches 2019 Atletico rows:', am.length);\nconsole.log('Sample:', am.slice(0, 10).map(r => r.datetime + ' ' + r.home_team + ' ' + r.home_goal + ' x ' + r.away_goal + ' ' + r.away_team));\nconst uniqueDates = new Set(am.map(r => r.datetime));\nconsole.log('Unique datetimes:', uniqueDates.size);\n\"","description":"Inspect raw Brasileirao_Matches data for Atletico 2019"},"output":"Brasileirao_Matches 2019 Atletico rows: 74\nSample: [\n  '2019-04-27 19:00:00 Atletico-MG 2 x 1 Avai-SC',\n  '2019-04-28 16:00:00 Atletico-PR 4 x 1 Vasco da Gama-RJ',\n  '2019-05-01 21:30:00 Fortaleza-CE 2 x 1 Atletico-PR',\n  '2019-05-01 21:30:00 Vasco da Gama-RJ 1 x 2 Atletico-MG',\n  '2019-05-04 21:00:00 Ceara-CE 1 x 2 Atletico-MG',\n  '2019-05-05 11:00:00 Chapecoense-SC 1 x 1 Atletico-PR',\n  '2019-05-12 16:00:00 Atletico-MG 0 x 2 Palmeiras-SP',\n  '2019-05-12 19:00:00 Atletico-PR 1 x 0 Bahia-BA',\n  '2019-05-18 19:00:00 Atletico-MG 2 x 1 Flamengo-RJ',\n  '2019-05-19 16:00:00 Atletico-PR 0 x 2 Corinthians-SP'\n]\nUnique datetimes: 66\n","metadata":{"output":"Brasileirao_Matches 2019 Atletico rows: 74\nSample: [\n  '2019-04-27 19:00:00 Atletico-MG 2 x 1 Avai-SC',\n  '2019-04-28 16:00:00 Atletico-PR 4 x 1 Vasco da Gama-RJ',\n  '2019-05-01 21:30:00 Fortaleza-CE 2 x 1 Atletico-PR',\n  '2019-05-01 21:30:00 Vasco da Gama-RJ 1 x 2 Atletico-MG',\n  '2019-05-04 21:00:00 Ceara-CE 1 x 2 Atletico-MG',\n  '2019-05-05 11:00:00 Chapecoense-SC 1 x 1 Atletico-PR',\n  '2019-05-12 16:00:00 Atletico-MG 0 x 2 Palmeiras-SP',\n  '2019-05-12 19:00:00 Atletico-PR 1 x 0 Bahia-BA',\n  '2019-05-18 19:00:00 Atletico-MG 2 x 1 Flamengo-RJ',\n  '2019-05-19 16:00:00 Atletico-PR 0 x 2 Corinthians-SP'\n]\nUnique datetimes: 66\n","exit":0,"description":"Inspect raw Brasileirao_Matches data for Atletico 2019","truncated":false},"title":"Inspect raw Brasileirao_Matches data for Atletico 2019","time":{"start":1782353634641,"end":1782353634643}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I see! The same fixture Vasco vs Atletico Mineiro on 2019-05-01/02 appears with slightly different dates (2019-05-01 vs 2019-05-02). So deduplication by exact date fails. This is a data quality issue. \n\nAlso, some fixtures appear twice with same date (e.g., Atletico Mineiro vs Vasco on 2019-04-28 and Vasco vs Atletico Mineiro on 2019-05-01 - these are home/away swapped? Actually one is Atletico Mineiro home, another is Vasco home, so they're different fixtures unless the data has errors).\n\nWait, in a normal season, Atletico Mineiro plays Vasco twice: once home, once away. So 2019-04-28 (Atletico Mineiro home) and 2019-05-01 (Vasco home) are two different matches. But both sources report a Vasco vs Atletico Mineiro match around that time. Let me see more.\n\nActually, the data may contain both home and away versions for the same match due to scheduling weirdness? No, each team plays each other twice.\n\nThe real issue is that Atlético Mineiro has 74 Brasileirão matches from Brasileirao_Matches.csv alone in 2019, which is almost double 38. This suggests the Brasileirao_Matches.csv dataset has duplicate or incorrect entries for 2019.\n\nLet me check the raw count in Brasileirao_Matches.csv for Atlético Mineiro 2019.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_efc8e123e001k805Bu6ElFsccF","sessionID":"ses_1038a1a43ffeeWzYwhyWkjkoD2","message